  "configuration_id": "config_030",
  "reason": "RNA-only multiprofile scvi_n200 with avgpool is currently the strongest direction (accuracy 0.650, F1 0.628), while image-only ResNet is weak (0.328 with multiprofile avgpool), leaving uncertainty about whether image information is complementary when fused with RNA. config_030 keeps the best RNA representation, profile setting, and aggregation, and adds only ResNet image features with simple concat fusion, directly testing whether multimodal fusion improves over the strong RNA baseline. This is a clean, minimal extension of the most promising evidence before testing more complex fusion, aggregation, or image-encoder choices."
}

